---
// Testimonials.astro - Performance Optimized
---
<section id="testimonials" class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 font-semibold mb-3">Customer Reviews</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
        What Our <span class="text-blue-900">Customers Say</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Don't just take our word for it. Here's what our satisfied customers have to say about our RO services. Real reviews from real people who trust us with their water purification needs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg" aria-hidden="true">RK</div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Rajesh Kumar</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Whitefield, Bangalore</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex text-yellow-400 text-sm mb-3" aria-label="5 star rating">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 italic">"My Kent RO stopped working suddenly. I called Rofix Service and their technician arrived within 2 hours. He replaced the pump with a genuine part and my purifier is working like new. Very professional service!"</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg" aria-hidden="true">PS</div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Priya Sharma</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Koramangala, Bangalore</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex text-yellow-400 text-sm mb-3" aria-label="5 star rating">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 italic">"I've been using their AMC plan for the past 1 year. Regular filter changes, timely reminders, and excellent customer support. The water quality has improved a lot. Highly recommended for families!"</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg" aria-hidden="true">AM</div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Arun Mehta</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">HSR Layout, Bangalore</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex text-yellow-400 text-sm mb-3" aria-label="5 star rating">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 italic">"Very honest pricing. They gave me a clear quote before starting the work and didn't charge anything extra. The technician also explained how to maintain the RO properly. Great experience!"</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Rating Summary Box -->
    <div class="mt-12 bg-blue-900 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="text-center md:text-left">
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">4.8 Star Rating</h3>
        <p class="text-blue-200 text-sm mt-1">Based on 150+ verified customer reviews</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 flex-wrap justify-center">
        <div class="text-yellow-400 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
        <a href="tel:+917090170092" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-yellow-500 hover:bg-yellow-600 text-slate-900 font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"></path>
          </svg>
          Call Now
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>